Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer brief",
      "text": "Website brief from buyer Mira Dalisay\n\nI run Tahanan Leaf Studio, a small shop in the Philippines. I need a simple five-page business website that introduces the shop and lets customers send inquiries. The pages should be Home, About, Products, Gallery, and Contact. Please make the layout usable on phones and include a contact form that sends messages to payer-1@example.test.\n\nSeller Niko Luntian will provide the site files and a short guide to updating the text. I will supply the product photographs and wording. We agreed on a fixed price of USD 480 for the complete build. No launch or delivery date has been agreed."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "Mira, 9:10 AM: Thanks for taking on the website. Can you confirm the contact form is included in the fixed price?\n\nNiko, 9:13 AM: Yes. The five-page website, contact form, site files, and editing guide are included for USD 480.\n\nMira, 9:16 AM: Great. I will send the photos and text separately. Please keep the colors quiet and make sure it works on a phone.\n\nNiko, 9:20 AM: That works. I'll start with a draft layout once I have the materials.\n\nMira, 9:22 AM: We haven't settled on a delivery date yet, so let's discuss timing after you review them.\n\nNiko, 9:24 AM: Agreed."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller invoice",
      "text": "Invoice from Niko Luntian, Philippines\nBill to: Mira Dalisay, Tahanan Leaf Studio\n\nService: Five-page business website build, including mobile-friendly layout and contact form\nQuantity: 1\nPrice: USD 480\n\nIncluded handover: website files and a short text-editing guide\nSubtotal: USD 480\nTotal due: USD 480\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe buyer will provide product photographs and website wording. The total is a fixed project price, not an hourly estimate. Any additional pages or features requested outside the brief will need a separate agreement before work begins. Delivery date: not agreed. Please contact Niko with any questions about the scope before paying."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: USD 480",
      "value": "USD 480"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: Five-page business website",
      "value": "Five-page business website"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: agreed delivery date",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Mira Dalisay",
      "value": "Mira Dalisay"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Niko Luntian",
      "value": "Niko Luntian"
    }
  ]
}
